WEBVTT

00:06:57.180 --> 00:07:00.230
when students are at home, 
et cetera, et cetera.

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:03.300
What kind of experience 
can we draw from these six months,

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:07.586
and what kind of real learning scheme

00:07:07.586 --> 00:07:10.626
we put into thinking 
about the future of education

00:07:10.626 --> 00:07:12.506
from these six months?

00:07:13.306 --> 00:07:16.796
So, I think every challenge 
comes with an opportunity.

00:07:16.796 --> 00:07:20.417
And I think the pandemic 
was really an eye-opener

00:07:20.417 --> 00:07:21.727
to all the educators

00:07:21.727 --> 00:07:25.157
to relook and reexamine 
what they have been doing for years

00:07:25.157 --> 00:07:27.986
and whether this was really 
the right model or not.

00:07:28.295 --> 00:07:31.941
And I think, even though 
a lot of the universities, including ours,